+//
+// What may be started: the Claude Code CLI, and nothing else. The command the caller names is never passed on -- the
+// launcher knows where the real claude.exe is and chooses it itself -- and a command that is not the CLI is refused
+// here with the same ENOENT a missing program gives, so a plugin that tries to run anything else fails as before.
